<title>FINLAND: Hackman sees '97 sales flat, demand weak.</title>
<headline>Hackman sees '97 sales flat, demand weak.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consumer goods group Oy Hackman Ab said on Monday sales in 1997 would be flat compared to 1996 and that demand in its main markets was weak.</p>
<p>&quot;The growth of demand is weak on our main markets. Sales are expected to remain during 1997 on the same level as 1996,&quot; Hackman said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
